		(comment 3 "MUTE: button pole adds +4.5 V to VC; DUCK: SC_ENV through the button, -1 V = 10 dB (decision 142)")
		(comment 4 "VCA stage inverts, U203 inverts back: POSTFADE same polarity as POSTFILT")
